          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida iishaayda gheeda giibinda mida jeeda mujiineeda sineaweesa hilooga, ghoamu gootini aba jeeda gweayda mughuush iing'ata sheaydeayda; abeeda iing'ata gweayda ea ninyas deaweedeeda jea gootina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama meetina aba jeeda gweayda mughuush, abeeda gheedida mida jeeda mujiineeda sineaweesa hiloogean gaygwadageanda siidida ghayi shaahiin, aba jeeda seaygoojigaaschi; majeetin aba gweayda giitinooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gealga gharang'weaka meeneaweesiina hilooga gajeekuuyi sea madameega ng'eanyiida; gajeamu eetin, ak gajeetin damanda giitinooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mujiinajeega fuga Lawi, was gealga mida mujiinajeega nyaawa ambal, ghoamu fuga Lawi gootini aba damanda wassean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa ghwasha siyagi bea Lawi gheeda ak ea mootina, abeeda gheedida sishaayda aba mujiini ambaliin gajeetin iihita damanda giitinooda; aba gideaba gealga mida mujiinajeega fuga Lawi gaygoombal aba jeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu madameega gealaan mida heeda mawoosa radaneeda aba ng'eanyiida neaweesa mujiinajeega nyaawa mwajeashaayda; aba gideaba nih heanyaawa ambal bea huumwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Weeta fuga barbari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amadeepa ghabwarbwariit orjeeda geamadu, ak ea mwoamu geaw aba jeedeang'wa, abeeda ghoaweachi; gawuurji rabascheanda ea bareanoocheanda aba jeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adigeandi gidanaawda aba headaanyi ghana nung' ghoahaada, gagasa awala ASEATAANG'U; ak goobiida orjeeda geamadu murdeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adinung' ghoalaajaneey lapiyeadaang'u nea gigasayi ghoahaada, ak ea adiidawi hamitaang'u nea gigasayi ghoahaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ghayi aruunaneey jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri ak gagoonyi ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ak ghaahuuyi ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siksiinda soomjooga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amadeepa ghabwarbwariit orjeeda geamadu aba murdeedeang'wa, ak ghwashaayda geaw aba heedeang'wa, ea majanung' gagadiiy gawuurji soomjeanda: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygawuurji niny aba heedeang'wa siida siitaw gadiyeeda biissa gawuurji rabascheanda. Gaygagadiyeeseey ea ghwahita gweayda giitinooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amang'ata gayghabeawa headaang'u, niny sea diibigaaschi goombal haleanjeeda ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba saawa fugeasu bea gadiyeeda, ghayi earuuni jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri; mwajeashaaydaayda soomjooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwajahaaghwiidana ng'weaninda, gagasa awala gheang'da ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu aba heeda headigeagwa ea gadeemgeagwa was soomjooga deepa andeawana: ghoamuuschi ashaaha ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda was soomjeanda aba jeeda eemoojiga neaweeseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoamuuschi ashaaha eara aba heeda rabasta mida jeedeang'wa sea fuga nyaawa mida jeedeang'wa, ghayi sijiilsa jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa; ak abeeda gwadeepa ghoah geagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoamuuschi anung' ghoah saawa fuga jea gwahearan orjoogeagwa, ak ghoah geanyaawa damanda manda muudeanooda; ak ghoanung' ghoah soomjooga, nea aba badahuuka buweadeegeagwa was fuga Israeli adoosawanayi geat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iibaruur rabascheanda ghana bareanoocheanda, nea ghabwarbwariit orjeeda geamadu mida murdeadaang'u ak ghwashaayda geaw aba heeda rabascheanda ghana heeda rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa, ghana heeda siida bea gheawagi sea rabascheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iing'ata nea sishaayda geamu eetin; gaygootin siyagi aba jeeda orjooga ghaamwat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana ea orjeeda ghamaghaamwadi ghana ea baleanda orjeeda ghamaghaamwadi ghoamu gootini, ghana ea buweacheanda neeki bea gheanyaawa ghoamu gootini; ghana iideepa gabaruur abeeda ghoamu gootini geaw niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygabalool sea siida ghayi shaah niny ghang'eada gweayda ghayi shaaydaawa geaw ea ghwahita gweayda giitinooda, abeeda mooneeda sheayeeda giitinoadaanyi gajeegala geat sea mooneeda gweanyeeka; ea damanda mideayeewa sea siidaanyi gajeegala damanda siida siitaw gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea gudughwashoada gweanyeeka saang'a, aba giduurji mooneeda gayghoaghuumda haleanjeeda mwaatkwa ghayi sishaaha aba giitinoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea sighus gweanyeeksu ng'ay aba hiteayda gweayda giitinooda, gaygabalool sea niny; aba giteena gweanyeeka gadiiyi aba headaanyi gayghoaghuumda lapiya aba giitinoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiwuurji siida gadiyeeda siitaw gadiyeeda gilakweay gaygwandeayi sea niny; ak ea maygwasawan aba madeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama meetina aba naweading'su, abeeda gajeetin aba gweayda giitinooda, niny sea diibigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga Israeli aba heedeanyu fuga gadiyeeda, saawa fugeasu bea gadiyeeda ghayi earuuni ng'eanyiida Misrihi: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
